            <?php itdgl_render_faq_accordion([
                'Which is the best D2C marketing agency for jewellery brands in India + Dubai + USA?' => 'ITD GrowthLabs runs full-funnel D2C jewellery marketing across India + UAE + USA + UK + Australia. We specialise in <strong>lab-grown diamond, demi-fine, gold, silver, fashion, and bridal jewellery</strong> &mdash; combining Meta + Google + AR try-on + BNPL + WhatsApp retention + creator seeding. Senior-led with 12+ years average team experience, 4&times;&ndash;7&times; blended ROAS targets. <a href="/services/d2c/jewellery-digital-marketing.php">See jewellery D2C service page</a>.',
                'What is a realistic monthly budget for jewellery D2C marketing in India?' => '<strong>Early stage (&#8377;1&ndash;5 Cr ARR)</strong>: &#8377;1.5&ndash;3 lakh retainer + &#8377;3&ndash;10 lakh ad spend. <strong>Growth stage (&#8377;5&ndash;25 Cr ARR)</strong>: &#8377;3&ndash;5 lakh retainer + &#8377;10&ndash;40 lakh ad spend. <strong>Scale (&#8377;25 Cr+)</strong>: &#8377;5&ndash;10 lakh retainer + &#8377;40 lakh&ndash;3 Cr ad spend. Wedding season (Oct&ndash;Feb) concentrates 40&ndash;55% of annual budget.',
                'What is a realistic monthly budget for jewellery D2C in Dubai + UAE?' => '<strong>Early stage</strong>: AED 8&ndash;20K retainer + AED 15&ndash;50K ad spend. <strong>Growth</strong>: AED 20&ndash;60K retainer + AED 50K&ndash;2 lakh ad spend. <strong>Scale</strong>: AED 60K&ndash;3 lakh retainer + AED 2&ndash;10 lakh ad spend. Ramadan + Eid + DSF drive concentrated peaks.',
                'What is a realistic monthly budget for jewellery D2C in USA?' => '<strong>Early stage</strong>: $3&ndash;8K retainer + $5&ndash;25K ad spend. <strong>Growth</strong>: $8&ndash;25K retainer + $25K&ndash;1 lakh ad spend. <strong>Scale</strong>: $25K&ndash;1 lakh retainer + $1&ndash;5 lakh ad spend. Q4 (Thanksgiving + Christmas + Valentine\'s) concentrates 40&ndash;55% of annual budget.',
                'What is a realistic monthly budget for jewellery D2C in UK + Australia?' => '<strong>UK</strong>: &pound;2.5&ndash;6K early, &pound;6&ndash;20K growth, &pound;20&ndash;80K scale retainer. Similar Q4 seasonality to USA. <strong>Australia</strong>: A$4&ndash;10K early, A$10&ndash;30K growth, A$30K&ndash;1 lakh scale retainer. Summer Christmas concentrates Q4 differently.',
                'What ROAS should a jewellery brand expect and by when?' => '<strong>First qualified traffic</strong>: 1&ndash;2 weeks. <strong>Optimised ROAS</strong>: 4&ndash;6 weeks, hitting <strong>4&times;&ndash;7&times; blended ROAS</strong> by month 3&ndash;4. Lab-grown diamond + demi-fine typically hit higher ROAS given lower AOV + faster consideration. Bridal + solitaire longer consideration + lower blended ROAS + higher assisted conversion.',
                'Do you handle AR try-on and 3D viewer integration?' => 'Yes &mdash; we integrate <strong>Mirrar AR (India), Perfect Corp YouCam, and 3D configurators from Cylindo / Threekit / Avataar</strong> for jewellery try-on on Shopify + custom stacks. AR drives 1.5&times;&ndash;2.5&times; conversion lift + 20&ndash;45% returns reduction on rings + earrings + necklaces.',
                'Do you build BNPL + EMI + international payment options?' => '<strong>India</strong>: Razorpay BNPL, Simpl, Bajaj Finserv, LazyPay, ZestMoney. <strong>UAE</strong>: Tabby, Tamara, Postpay. <strong>USA</strong>: Affirm, Klarna, Afterpay. <strong>UK/AU</strong>: Klarna, Clearpay. EMI display on PDP + cart lifts conversion 35&ndash;55% on orders above the AOV threshold.',
                'What creator + influencer strategy works for jewellery D2C?' => '<strong>India</strong>: nano + micro (10K&ndash;100K followers), skin-tone + wedding + region-specific creator roster. <strong>Dubai</strong>: expat + Arab creator mix + Arabic + English content. <strong>USA</strong>: TikTok + Instagram + Pinterest bridal + demi-fine creators. Per quarter 30&ndash;50 creators paid + gifted + revenue-share. UGC harvested for paid ads.',
                'How do you handle wedding season peaks for jewellery brands?' => '<strong>India wedding season</strong>: Oct&ndash;Feb + April&ndash;June concentrated bridal + occasion. <strong>Diwali + Karva Chauth</strong>: peak occasion buying. <strong>Dubai</strong>: DSF (Dec&ndash;Feb) + Ramadan + Eid. <strong>USA</strong>: engagement season (Nov&ndash;Feb) + Valentine\'s + Mother\'s Day. We prep inventory + creative + budgets 6&ndash;8 weeks ahead of each peak.',
                'Do you handle Amazon + Nykaa + Myntra marketplace strategy?' => 'Yes &mdash; marketplace for trial + volume + brand.com for margin + retention. <strong>Amazon India + USA</strong>: Sponsored Products + Sponsored Brands + Sponsored Display. <strong>Nykaa Fashion + Myntra + Ajio</strong>: fashion jewellery placement + private-label positioning. Separate KPIs, cross-channel attribution.',
                'What compliance + certification do jewellery brands need?' => '<strong>India</strong>: BIS hallmarking mandatory + Gems &amp; Jewellery Export Promotion Council. <strong>USA</strong>: FTC Green Guide + Kimberly Process for diamonds + IGI/GIA certification. <strong>UAE</strong>: Dubai Municipality assaying + hallmarking. <strong>UK + AU</strong>: hallmarking + Assay Office UK / Australian regulation.',
                'Do you build subscription + repeat purchase programs for jewellery?' => 'Jewellery not natural subscription category but repeat + LTV strategy works. <strong>Anniversary + milestone reminder programs</strong>, <strong>upgrade + trade-in programs</strong>, <strong>tier-based loyalty</strong> (Silver/Gold/Platinum), <strong>curated drop calendar</strong>. Wedding + engagement customers convert to gifting + anniversary + upgrade cycle over 5&ndash;10 years.',
                'How do you handle returns + insurance + shipping for high-AOV jewellery?' => '<strong>India</strong>: insured shipping via BlueDart / DTDC secure + Razorpay Trust Badge. <strong>International</strong>: FedEx / DHL insured + duties handling. Return rate 8&ndash;15% typical for online jewellery &mdash; AR + video PDPs + accurate sizing reduces this to 4&ndash;8%.',
                'Do you handle jewellery brand launches from zero?' => 'Yes &mdash; brand identity + Shopify + supply chain + payment stack + Meta + Google + Amazon + WhatsApp + creator + PR + hallmarking + insurance. Typical launch runway 8&ndash;12 weeks. First revenue in month 2, break-even by month 6&ndash;9 for well-positioned brands.',
                'Do you build WhatsApp + email + SMS retention for jewellery brands?' => 'Yes &mdash; WhatsApp Business API + Klaviyo (USA / international) or WebEngage / MoEngage (India). Anniversary + milestone reminder + care instructions + upgrade offers. WhatsApp typically drives 25&ndash;40% of revenue for mature jewellery D2C brands in India.',
                'How do you approach lab-grown diamond marketing specifically?' => 'Lab-grown is fastest-growing jewellery segment globally. <strong>Education-heavy content</strong>: why lab-grown, ethical + environmental positioning, price comparison. <strong>Certification</strong>: IGI / GIA proof on every product. <strong>Younger + millennial + Gen Z creators</strong>. <strong>Price transparency</strong>: value vs mined diamond centrepiece.',
                'Do you handle jewellery brand international expansion from India?' => 'Yes &mdash; India-origin premium jewellery brands often 3&times; LTV internationally. <strong>USA</strong>: Delaware C-corp + Stripe + Shopify + FedEx. <strong>UK</strong>: UK Ltd + Stripe UK + Klarna. <strong>UAE</strong>: FZ entity + Tabby + AED-denominated. <strong>Compliance</strong>: hallmarking + certification + duties handling.',
                'Do you offer a Contact Form / Calendly / WhatsApp for jewellery brand founders?' => 'Yes &mdash; three ways to start: <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min">Calendly (30-min senior discovery call)</a>, <a href="https://wa.me/918450978544">WhatsApp us directly</a>, or fill the <a href="/contact-us.php">contact form</a>. Senior strategist responds within 24 hours.',
                'How is ITD GrowthLabs different from other jewellery marketing agencies?' => '<strong>Senior-led</strong>: 12+ years average team experience, no junior handoffs. <strong>Full-stack</strong>: tech (Shopify + AR + BNPL) + marketing (Meta + Google + creator + WhatsApp) built together. <strong>Fixed-quote retainer</strong>: no percentage of ad spend. <strong>Multi-region</strong>: India + Dubai + USA + UK + Australia experience. <strong>Full ownership</strong>: your accounts, your data, your creative &mdash; always.',
